;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Something's definitely off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE> letting two people into the house at this hour on a weekday.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And those two had come to the shop during the day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hadn't caught it clearly, but they seemed to be worried about being seen.<PG>
Could it have something to do with this morning's incident?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Knowing <STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE>, when something like that happens, she wants to stick her nose in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that's the case―<PG>
I'd noticed even before I went into the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Several cars were parked around the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At some distance, but as if they were surrounding this house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it was connected to this morning's incident, then either the police or a criminal organization.<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Maybe I'll look into it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not that I came out because I had something to do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just felt uncomfortable at home, for no real reason.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And maybe it's also because I'm <STYLE ID="1">Erina's</STYLE> sister―
{PAUSE ""}
I'm a little interested in this situation myself.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
1―
{PAUSE ""}
2―
{PAUSE ""}
3―
{PAUSE ""}
4 cars.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Four cars were parked on the street within a 100-meter radius of the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And every car had several people in it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, parked and waiting inside the cars.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, they weren't necessarily all inside the cars.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My movements might already be under watch, too.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "300" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="2">"Mm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wind grew gradually stronger, and a blizzard of cherry petals began to swirl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if the calm, cloudy sky of the daytime had been a lie, the sky cleared completely and a strong wind blew.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A spring storm, I suppose.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\死神グレー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I saw something move in the dim shadows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was a person, no doubt about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was moving forward, checking its surroundings as if to avoid being seen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if to avoid being seen...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just like <STYLE ID="1">Erina's</STYLE> friends.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\死神グレー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\swish1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "11" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\道1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
............!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The figure suddenly vanished.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I thought I'd seen a faint afterimage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did that mean it had moved so fast it only seemed to vanish?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that didn't look like a human being's movement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could that be the Megasawa City case's―<PG>
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I hurried over to a car parked nearby.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\連続ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Excuse me! You're the police, right!? Excuse me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\連続ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I pounded on the car window hard enough to break it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that figure just now was the culprit, this car was almost certainly the police.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, there was a good chance the culprit had headed for the house!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"What's the matter?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A <STYLE ID="3">man</STYLE> with an earpiece still in his ear got out of the car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um! You're after the culprit from this morning's incident, aren't you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　You think the culprit's likely headed for my house―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">the Goto residence, don't you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I made a fuss like that, the <STYLE ID="3">man's</STYLE> expression changed before my eyes.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It was here just now! There was a figure right there, and it vanished in an instant!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Damn! Showed up, huh!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー通話ノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Hey! All cars, listen! We have an eyewitness report on the culprit! Get to the Goto residence, now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
More men got out of the cars, and <STYLE ID="3">the man I'd been talking to</STYLE> ran off toward the house too.<PG>
It seemed my guess had been right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, I couldn't imagine them believing a tip from an ordinary civilian like me this easily.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably the testimony 'a figure vanished in an instant' and the fact that it was headed for my house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those must have been what confirmed it was the culprit.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I ran after them too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, the culprit from this morning's incident was heading for my house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And there was a good chance that culprit was also the culprit of the Megasawa City case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone like that was heading for <STYLE ID="1">my sister</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no way I could just stand by in a situation like this...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
All the lights in the house were off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth was going on?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had the culprit already gotten in!?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\銃声6発.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, a gunshot from inside the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You've got to be kidding!? A gunfight, with <STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE> in there...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then a slender figure came staggering out through the gate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I quickly hid behind a utility pole and watched.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it the culprit, coming out after being shot?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
No, that was <STYLE ID="4">one of Erina's friends</STYLE> who'd come to the shop during the day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since <STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE> had been in the house all along, the figure that vanished earlier was someone else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was <STYLE ID="4">she</STYLE> the only one who'd gotten out of the house?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">She</STYLE> walked off in the opposite direction from me―toward Central Park.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "2000" "PASS"}
Next, a man （probably a police officer） came running out after <STYLE ID="4">her</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
And the man held his radio to his mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Inspector</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="4">The protectee</STYLE> is walking toward Central Park! I'm securing her immediately!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー通話ノイズ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Your call! We've got our hands full here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Roger! Securing her right away!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ran straight up to the man.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wait! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">My sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is in there, isn't she!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"W-who are <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE>!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sister! You protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">my sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But if I don't secure <STYLE ID="4">that girl</STYLE>―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The man's refusal to listen made my blood boil, 
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
and I slammed my fist into his face as hard as I could.<PG>
"Wha...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I snatched the handgun the man had been holding, 
{PAUSE ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\拳銃桃子.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
and ran into the house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"W-wait! Hey!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait, he says?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No way! I have to get to <STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE> as fast as I can!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Culprit of the Megasawa City case or whoever else, I'll never forgive them!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{MESON "500"}
When I opened the door, I heard lots of footsteps on the second floor.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Get back! Drop your weapon! This house is already surrounded!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Everyone, the prefectural police included, has you marked! Give it up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The loud voice of <STYLE ID="3">the man from before</STYLE> carried down from the second floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I ran up the dark stairs.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\五島家二階廊下夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Move! Get out of the way!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　What do you think you're doing, running wild in somebody's home!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shoved past the police officers blocking the hallway and headed for <STYLE ID="1">Erina's</STYLE> room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋月.gal" "NORMAL" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
And there, wearing a Noh mask and red cloth, was the strange figure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No doubt about it, it was the same figure I'd seen earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this was the culprit of the Megasawa City case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\銃を構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\桃子銃.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Without a moment's pause, I pointed the muzzle at the strange figure.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! What are you doing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Shut up!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　You used </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">my sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and her friends as bait to lure the culprit, didn't you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Never mind that, just get out of here, now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I swung the muzzle around onto the <STYLE ID="3">police officer</STYLE> coming toward me.
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物3\r\n3\r\n700\r\n200\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"H-hey! Stop that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Shut your mouth!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
